09:47.897 --> 09:48.797
<b>Kalau kamu?</b>

09:48.877 --> 09:50.597
<b>N-Namaku Yuki Hiroshi.</b>

09:50.857 --> 09:54.837
<b>Hiro-kun, aku juga
